{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47285","headline":"游仙二十四首 二十二 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予招三清友，逈出九天上。\n挠挑绝漠中，差池遥相望。\n大空含常明，八外无隐障。\n鸾凤有逸翮，泠然恣飘扬。\n寥寥唯玄虚，至乐在神王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}